  "content": "<p>這是一個小型石族介面大修模組相容包的集合。我們會不定期更新，同時也會考慮使用者的請求。歡迎在<a href=\"https://github.com/mxKeaton/Denis-Stoneborn-Additions/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報區</a>提出您的建議！</p><h3>完整相容性支援：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">美化模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" rel=\"nofollow\">碎片模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcompletionists-index\" rel=\"nofollow\">完成者索引</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feven-better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\">更佳考古學</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrostiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜寒之境</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finmis\" rel=\"nofollow\">隨身背包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fitemswapper\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品切換器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組選單</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-banner-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多旗幟功能</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fno-chat-reports\" rel=\"nofollow\">無聊天舉報</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funiversal-sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用鋸木廠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frecursiveresources\" rel=\"nofollow\">遞歸資源</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fscorchful\" rel=\"nofollow\">灼熱之境</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstorage-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲物樂趣</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsuperb-steeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">卓越坐騎</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftieredz\" rel=\"nofollow\">分層系統</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\">交易站</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftransmog\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻化系統</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwigs\" rel=\"nofollow\">細枝模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funiversal-graves\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用墓碑</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillagersplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民增強</a></li>\n</ul><h3>文字修正與小幅新增：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">補充模組</a></li>\n</ul><h3>文字修正：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事（重製版）</a></li>\n</ul><h3>建議排序順序：</h3><ul>\n<li>STONEBORN - Denis 擴充套件</li>\n<li><em>其他 STONEBORN 附加元件</em></li>\n<li>STONEBORN 介面大修</li>\n</ul><p>特別感謝原始<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fstoneborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">STONEBORN 介面大修</a>資源包及其創作者。</p>",
